*HEADING
Nanoindentation - Conical indenter - Fe16Cr0
Units: nm, microN, GPa
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../geometry/cone_substrate.inp
*NSET, NSET=Naxis, ELSET=axis
*NSET, NSET=Nbottom, ELSET=bottom
*NSET, NSET=Nright, ELSET=right
*NSET, NSET=Ncontact, ELSET=contact
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../material_cards/calculix_material_cards_best.inp
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Surface1, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Line1, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Line2, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Line3, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Line4, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Line5, MATERIAL=Fe16Cr0
*BOUNDARY
Naxis, 1, 1, 0.0
*BOUNDARY
Nbottom, 1, 2, 0.0
*BOUNDARY
Nright, 1, 1, 0.0
*STEP, INC=100
*STATIC
0.01, 1.0, 1e-6, 0.1
*BOUNDARY
Ncontact, 2, 2, -20.0
*NODE FILE
U
*EL FILE
S
*NODE PRINT, NSET=Ncontact, FREQUENCY=1
U, RF
*END STEP
